  "content": "<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"width: 124px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/zipestudio.png?raw=true\" title=\"是我\">\n      </div>\n    </td>\n    <td style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/fast-recipe\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/github.png?raw=true\" title=\"GitHub页面\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-recipe\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/modrinth.png?raw=true\" title=\"Modrinth页面\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-recipe\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/curseforge.png?raw=true\" title=\"CurseForge页面\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display: flex;\">\n          <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/XmGF7rkkuY\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/discord.png?raw=true\" title=\"Discord账号\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://t.me/zipeleaf\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/telegram.png?raw=true\" title=\"Telegram频道\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/zipestudio/tip\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/support.png?raw=true\" title=\"支持我（谢谢）\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n![\"描述\" 标题](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSdescription.png?raw=true)\n\n**快速合成** 是一款客户端模组，为合成配方书添加了快速合成功能。在配方上按下 [Ctrl + 鼠标左键] 即可瞬间完成合成。\n\n![\"装饰灯\" 图片](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/fast-recipe/blob/master/img/separator_sprite.png?raw=true)\n\n![\"展示\" 图片](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/fast-recipe/blob/master/img/showcase.gif?raw=true)\n\n![\"支持\" 标题](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSsupport.png?raw=true)\n\n### 想支持模组和作者吗？只需告诉大家这个模组的存在！\n\n没错，你说得对。仅仅通过宣传，你就能很好地支持模组和创作者。知道这个模组的人越多，下载量就越大，下载量的增加会给作者带来动力，并增加网站收入（相当于免费捐赠）。**请记住，宣传不可过于强硬或令人反感！**\n\n### 你可以做什么？\n- 制作视频评测/广告\n- 在社交媒体或Discord上分享\n- 告诉你的朋友这个模组\n- 添加到你的整合包中，或者直接下载并享受游戏\n\n> 每一次提及都意义非凡——感谢你帮助社区成长🤍\n\n![\"许可\" 标题](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSlicensing.png?raw=true)\n\n### [查看原模组仓库](https://github.com/ZipeStudio/fast-recipe)",
